# A4b: follower sink sweep, hard (downward) step v(out)_rest = 1.65 - 0.5 V, C_s reset to 1.65 V.  BM_KSF = number of 16u/4u mirror legs of the follower sink (A4a/A4b baseline 6, typ 5.2 uA, 3.3-8.4 uA over PVT).
err = v(C_s)(t0 + 11.05 us) - v(out)_rest, LSB (sign: the held value is above the rest value when positive).  Required: |err| <= 0.5 LSB at 9 PVT.
