   extra sink per channel = (BM_KSF - 6) x 0.87 uA typ (master 0.85 uA x 1 unit/leg: follower sink = 5.2 uA typ at BM_KSF 6); x N channels x 3.3 V = power: N = 8 (Decision 29): KSF 24 -> +15.7 uA x 8 x 3.3 V = 0.41 mW typ, KSF 36 -> +26 uA x 8 x 3.3 V = 0.69 mW typ (the sweep itself is for the +-0.5 V step after the 1.65 V reset; with one ADC per channel (Decision 34) the reset is optional and the window ~245 us: see a4b_adc245.log).
